ategories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"X1aAjsufci2ibaxSbhFl4Q","review_id":"Z5_0VvKrx4EpbyOaaFOocA","date":"2020-06-28T05:34:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9504023790359497,"text_excerpt":"I'm not going to lie - the name of the place and its sign outside kind of deterred me from visiting this place; it wasn't until my friend asked me to go did I finally muster up the courage to do so. And honestly, don't make the same mistake I did. First off, they have a parking lot. We know how difficult that is to find around here so that's a major plus. The server/co-owner(?) was really friendly and helped us choose what we should get. My friend got the ramen whereas I opted for the Yakiniku poboy and Cajun fries. Man, first off the Cajun fries are perfectly crispy and the sauce that it comes with is sooo good. He wouldn't tell us what it's made of, but he doesn't know how persistent I ..."},{"business_id":"X1aAjsufci2ibaxSbhFl4Q","review_id":"nj3Q18jMM--oA0tvjP68Ow","date":"2020-08-08T23:43:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9451009631156921,"text_excerpt":"This is a fantastic place! The ramen is BOMB and I cannot recommend it more highly if you are deciding what to order here. I tried the Tonkotsu Ramen and the veggie ramen and both were delicious. I love all the options they have too with the cajun / japanese concept, and it makes it a really great restaurant to go to with families and friends that may have different taste preferences."},{"business_id":"X1aAjsufci2ibaxSbhFl4Q","review_id":"Ub5ACKRJZkxyS_8lp2p8OA","date":"2020-09-21T23:25:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9425361156463623,"text_excerpt":"Better than your average po-boy! The atmosphere was a little odd but oddly homey. Ramen - really good, not the best I've ever had but very solid. The prices are great and everything was yummy. This restaurant offers a really good mix of Cajun and Japanese cuisine; very unique! Also, I recommend the cajun fries. And the employees were very wholesome."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"X1aAjsufci2ibaxSbhFl4Q","photo_id":"yGjCAIQ4lRG_onhno20uzQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/yGjCAIQ4lRG_onhno20uzQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8447703123092651},{"business_id":"X1aAjsufci2ibaxSbhFl4Q","photo_id":"rY5UBny9BwKbIq0ta0lKYQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rY5UBny9BwKbIq0ta0lKYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8425527811050415},{"business_id":"X1aAjsufci2ibaxSbhFl4Q","photo_id":"RvGxv7DPeayNZaH4FWqYqQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RvGxv7DPeayNZaH4FWqYqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8320517539978027},{"business_id":"X1aAjsufci2ibaxSbhFl4Q","photo_id":"ZcBJ1--GPVBHpQZJqKeMpQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ZcBJ1--GPVBHpQZJqKeMpQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8274279832839966}]},"notebook_case":null}
